## Scope of this notice (added 2026-08-22 · decision D-103)

This file is the **retained upstream notice** for content borrowed from
`babamba2/superclaude-for-sap` (via the frozen `hjaewon/sc4sap-custom`).
It is **not the license of the SAPKIT plugin** — that is the repository root
`LICENSE` (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hong Jaewon). Nothing above has been
altered; this section only records what the notice above still covers.

As of 2026-08-22 that is **36 files, all under `interactive/server/`**:

- `sap-assets/` — **30 files**. ABAP sources for the SAP-side `ZMCP_ADT_*` and
  `Z*_S4SAP_*` objects. Kept as-is by decision D-079 ⑥: SAP objects already
  installed on a customer system are never renamed or regenerated, so these
  install scripts stay upstream-authored. They have not been modified since
  they entered this repository.
- `tool-catalog/` — **4 files** (`sc4sap-mcp-tools*.md`).
- `verify-engine.mjs` · `bundle-keyring.mjs` — **2 files**.

Everything else under `interactive/` is the repository owner's own work:
knowledge, personas, procedures, policies, skills, adapters, scripts, and the
bundled MCP server. The server bundle became so on 2026-08-19 (D-095, replaced
by the in-repo `sapkit-engine`); the knowledge branch was re-authored file by
file and finished on 2026-08-18.
